### Say (Cap'n Web HTTP batch)
# Newline-delimited Cap'n Web wire messages. The two lines push the
# `say("hello-pos-backend")` call (import id 1) and pull its result. The body
# must NOT end in a newline, or the transport sees an empty trailing message.
POST http://127.0.0.1:50050/api

["push",["pipeline",0,["say"],["hello-pos-backend"]]]
["pull",1]

